<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Auto-Seed Brackets - NYIT Badminton</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/static/style.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css">
</head>
<body>
    <nav>
        <div class="container">
            <a href="/" class="logo">🏸 <span>Team</span> Manager</a>
            <div class="nav-links">
                <a href="/">Home</a>
                <a href="/dashboard">Dashboard</a>
                {% if current_user.role == 'admin' %}
                    <a href="/admin" class="admin-link">⭐ Admin</a>
                {% endif %}
                <a href="/logout" class="logout-link">🚪 Logout</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </nav>

    <div class="container">
        <div class="section">
            <h2 style="text-align: center;">🤖 Automated Bracket Seeding</h2>
            <p style="text-align: center; color: var(--text-muted); margin-bottom: 30px;">Use performance ratings to automatically distribute teams and create a balanced bracket</p>

            <form method="POST" class="card" style="max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center;">
                <div class="form-group" style="margin-bottom: 30px;">
                    <label>Select Tournament</label>
                    <select name="tournament_id" required style="width: 100%; padding: 15px; font-size: 16px;">
                        <option value="">-- Select Tournament --</option>
                        {% for t in tournaments %}
                            <option value="{{ t.id }}">{{ t.name }}</option>
                        {% endfor %}
                    </select>
                </div>

                <div style="background: var(--bg-main); padding: 20px; border-radius: var(--radius-md); margin-bottom: 30px; text-align: left; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted);">
                    <h4 style="margin-bottom: 10px; color: var(--text-main);">How it works:</h4>
                    <ul style="padding-left: 20px; line-height: 1.8;">
                        <li>Calculates <strong>Composite Ratings</strong> for all players based on their last 5 performance reviews.</li>
                        <li>Creates <strong>Balanced Teams</strong> by pairing the highest-rated players with the lowest-rated.</li>
                        <li>Applies <strong>Standard Seeding</strong> (Seed 1 vs Seed N) to prevent top teams from meeting in early rounds.</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>

                <button type="submit" class="btn-primary" style="padding: 15px 40px; font-size: 18px; border-radius: 50px; width: 100%;">
                    ⚡ Generate Auto-Seeded Bracket
                </button>
            </form>
        </div>
    </div>

    <footer style="margin-top: 80px;">
        <div class="container">
            <p style="font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 15px; color: white;">🏸 NYIT Badminton Team Manager</p>
            <div style="display: flex; justify-content: center; gap: 25px; margin-bottom: 25px;">
                <a href="https://www.instagram.com/nyit_badmintonli" target="_blank" style="color: white; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 500; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; opacity: 0.8; transition: var(--transition);">
                    <i class="fa-brands fa-instagram"></i> Instagram
                </a>
                <a href="https://linktr.ee/nyit_badminton" target="_blank" style="color: white; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 500; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; opacity: 0.8; transition: var(--transition);">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-link"></i> Linktree
                </a>
            </div>
            <p style="font-size: 12px; opacity: 0.5;">© 2024 NYIT Badminton. All Rights Reserved.</p>
        </div>
    </footer>
</body>
</html>
